  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "質能均衡",
    "sub_ename": "MATERIAL AND ENERGY BALANCES",
    "describe_ch": "在質能均衡的課程中將探討化工計算的基本原理（能量平衡、質量平衡）的問題。在這個學期裡將從基本定義，在質量平衡的教學中將帶領著同學瞭解單一系統甚至多重系統的問題。在本課程中也將探討在單元系統的反應。",
    "describe_eh": "This is the first semester for the class of the basic principle of the Chemical Engineering Calculation (Mass-Energy-Balance).  In this semester, we will start with the basic definitions related to the basic chemical engineering calculation.  Material balance over a system unit will be conducts allowing students to understand the concept of mass conservation within a system unit as well as multiple units system.  Reaction within the unit will also be discussed in this class.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使能瞭解並說明系統在不同操作條件下所代表的重點與意義",
      "describe_en": "Understand and elucidate the importance of the system under different operational process."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "運用相關理論基礎並引導運用電腦運算系統來獲得相關的解答",
      "describe_en": "Be able to use their theoretical knowledge to transfer them into the computer added calculation scheme and achieved desired solution　"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "使能夠了解計算結果所代表的物理意義並提出改善方法來提升對程序現象的了解",
      "describe_en": "Be able to understand the physical meaning of the calculated results and provide the improved method to enhance the understanding of the process　"
    }
  ],
